Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 25-4 (1), funds subject to settlement calculated according to the standards classified in the following subparagraphs shall be managed in a manner falling under any of the subparagraphs of the amended provisions of that paragraph until the date on which 2 years elapse from the enforcement date of this Act:
