Article 3 (Transitional measures concerning changes in standards for requirements such as capital)
Electronic financial business entities registered under the previous provisions at the time this Act enters into force shall satisfy the requirements for capital, total amount of investment, or fundamental property under the amended provisions of Article 30 (3) within 1 year from the enforcement date of this Act, notwithstanding the amended provisions of that paragraph.
